  "source_availability": "Third-party source is available under each package original license, separately from the project licenses.\nThe manifest records exact npm package versions, registry tarballs and integrity digests.\nMermaid and other npm dependencies are unmodified upstream packages processed by the site bundler; the application does not change their upstream source.\n\nelkjs 0.9.3 is distributed under EPL-2.0. Its corresponding upstream source and build instructions are available at https://github.com/kieler/elkjs/tree/0.9.3 (source archive https://github.com/kieler/elkjs/archive/refs/tags/0.9.3.tar.gz).\nThe upstream ELK sources are available at https://github.com/eclipse-elk/elk/tree/v0.9.1; The official 0.9.3 release notes also identify additional ELK pull request 955; its source change is at https://github.com/eclipse-elk/elk/pull/955/files. See https://github.com/kieler/elkjs/releases/tag/0.9.3 and build.gradle for the upstream source/build composition. The included EPL-2.0 text and original upstream notices apply.\nThe elkjs precompiled Java runtime also contains GWT, Guava, EMF GWT and Xtext xbase classes. The following fixed upstream archives supply the corresponding runtime source. The attribution files retain the original distinct copyright/license headers from each archive as a coverage set; this does not assert that every archive member is used by this site. The elkjs runtime bundle fingerprint ties these reviewed attributions to this distribution.\n\nGWT user runtime 2.10.0 (Apache-2.0): https://repo.maven.apache.org/maven2/org/gwtproject/gwt-user/2.10.0/gwt-user-2.10.0.jar\nSHA-256: b51edadffd969cda823e1fa3dcc4e43b3d9e5a338ba7f190c7ac3db8919f9b9d\nGuava runtime 31.1-jre (Apache-2.0): https://repo.maven.apache.org/maven2/com/google/guava/guava/31.1-jre/guava-31.1-jre-sources.jar\nSHA-256: 8ab1853cdaf936ec88be80c17302b7c20abafbd4f54d4fb54d7011c529e3a44a\nEMF GWT common runtime 2.12.4 (EPL-1.0): https://repo.maven.apache.org/maven2/com/genmymodel/emf/gwt/emf-common/2.12.4/emf-common-2.12.4-sources.jar\nSHA-256: 8dfc4e97ca8eee5474927e2b0c5f3bdbd9a52dcd5dff8c0b433b1e938b843bbe\nEMF GWT ecore runtime 2.12.4 (EPL-1.0): https://repo.maven.apache.org/maven2/com/genmymodel/emf/gwt/emf-ecore/2.12.4/emf-ecore-2.12.4-sources.jar\nSHA-256: dd3b8c1c3bd0a27c1fbba908bcf0ff21a999148da4e68b3546bcde1dbce7b13a\nXtext xbase runtime 2.28.0 (EPL-2.0): https://repo.maven.apache.org/maven2/org/eclipse/xtext/org.eclipse.xtext.xbase.lib/2.28.0/org.eclipse.xtext.xbase.lib-2.28.0-sources.jar\nSHA-256: 2b35e9ccd4308f605e213371bb26f458b6a84bbd1e3a13cecaac0eba607db69f\n",
